    "assessment": "Positive: profile-specific behavior remains abstracted behind injected adapters, there is no AWS/on-prem branching in business logic, and the request path does not perform hidden OCR/extraction work. Negative: the implementation reads the full upload into memory, provides no performance evidence for the 5s target, has no observability/security gate evidence, and most importantly lacks durable dispatch recovery semantics. A broker failure can strand a persisted uploaded document in state=uploaded with audit recorded but no processing work guaranteed."
